# Kiko deal tracker — cron example
#
# Runs one full tracking run every day at 07:15 (server local time).
# Install with:  crontab scripts/kiko.cron   (edit paths first!)
#
# Columns: min hour day month weekday  command
#
# Adjust /opt/kiko to wherever you deployed the project, and make sure the
# virtualenv path and config file are correct. Output is appended to a log.

15 7 * * * cd /opt/kiko && /opt/kiko/.venv/bin/python -m deal_tracker.main --config /opt/kiko/config.yaml run >> /opt/kiko/logs/cron.log 2>&1
